accTitle: Three independent database connection requirements
accDescr: Startup credential resolution, task-to-database ingress and writer discovery must all succeed.
SECRET[Secrets Manager password]:::storage -->|secrets valueFrom at startup| TASK[Fargate application]:::inputData
TASK -->|TCP 3306 from task SG| RULE{Aurora SG permits task SG?}:::decision
RULE -->|yes| HOST[Cluster writer hostname]
HOST -->|before failover| A[Writer A]:::storage
HOST -->|after failover and reconnect| B[Promoted writer B]:::storage
RULE -->|no| BLOCK[Connection blocked]:::warning
